SUMMARY:Hacia Cuando: An Opera
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Hacia Cuando: An Opera is a cross-geographical experimental ope
 ra-performance created in the mode of an exquisite corpse. The work brings
  together the creative practices of Jenny Olivia Johnson\, composer and so
 und artist based in Los Angeles\; Javier Bustos\, Argentinian experimental
  luthier and sound artist\; Sebastián Muirhead\, Chilean opera singer and
  stage director\; and Chilean-American visual artist Daniela Rivera.\nhttp
 s://massmoca.org/event/hacia-cuando-an-opera/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/hacia-cuando-an-opera/
END:VEVENT
